WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.672
This briefing comes from Book 05 of
the Federal Modernization Workbook,

2
00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:07.830
Devices and Endpoints:
the move from Group Policy

3
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.988
to Intune for devices, and
to Azure Arc for servers.

4
00:00:10.988 --> 00:00:12.995
I'll take it through four questions:

5
00:00:12.995 --> 00:00:16.940
why Group Policy can't simply be
carried to the cloud, what replaces it,

6
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:20.124
who owns the endpoint, and
how to migrate a fleet without

7
00:00:20.124 --> 00:00:23.238
losing the governance Group
Policy quietly provided.

8
00:00:23.238 --> 00:00:26.213
The short version: this is
not a settings migration.

9
00:00:26.213 --> 00:00:27.840
It's a governance rebuild.
